      "content": "Best-effort OpenAPI for the Dropbox Sign (formerly HelloSign) v3 eSignature API covering accounts, API apps, bulk send jobs, embedded edit / sign URLs, and fax operations. Authoritative spec lives at https://github.com/hellosign/hellosign-openapi.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: API Evangelist\n Email: kin@apievangelist.com",
